  "goodToKnow": "Das Küken is a chick, and figuratively the youngest in a group: das Küken der Mannschaft. In 2022, Germany became one of the first countries to ban Kükentöten, the killing of male chicks in egg production, now avoided by sexing eggs in the shell. At Easter, yellow Küken are a popular decoration. Plural: die Küken."
